DESCRIPTION:Topic: Want to flag to TTC where to improve service? Here's th
 e data to support it\n\nTransitBunny RT turns GTFS-realtime data into an i
 nteractive view of how transit service is actually operating throughout th
 e day. The presentation will discuss how GTFS-realtime can be used to iden
 tify bottlenecks and irregularity in transit performance.\n\n‎\n\nSpeake
 r: Luke Li (via Zoom)\n\nLuke Li is a transit planning professional with m
 ore than 10 years of experience in traffic operations\, transit operation\
 , network planning\, and service design. Luke has contributed to the plann
 ing of several rapid transit projects across North America.\n\n‎‎‎\n
 \nAgenda:\n\n7:00-7:20 Welcome and Introductions\n\n7:20-7:50 Presentation
  and Q\\&A/discussion\n\n7:50-9:00 Breakout groups\n\n‎\n\nCode of Condu
 ct: https://civictech.ca/about-us\n\n‎\n\nCheck in with us on the Civic 
 Tech Toronto Slack: https://link.civictech.ca/chat\n\n‎\n\nAbout Us:\n\n
 Our weekly civic meetups bring together Torontonians (designers\, coders\,
